# Looking for the least a loan asks of memory on the stand-in while it
# still carries the stand-in's rate: rings of 128 then 64, the held
# buffer from 256 KiB down to 128 KiB, 8 and 6 WRITEs let in, and one
# copy.  CELL_BOUNCE=1 so that each cell's draw on the region is its own
# footprint (../LOAN-PERFORMANCE.md).  Put the port's rings back to 256
# afterwards.
#     SGL_BACKING=/hs/nvme0/zcbudget-nvmet.img NULLB_MIB=16384 HW_ANY_MTU=1 RX_LINGER_US=50 PLACE=1 PRP_DIR=/hs/nvme0/zcbudget STEP_JOBS=16 STEP_BS=8M STEP_SECS=50 CELL_REST=30 CELL_BOUNCE=1
128 262144 8 sgl step-on-n16
128 262144 6 sgl step-on-n16
128 196608 8 sgl step-on-n16
128 131072 8 sgl step-on-n16
64 262144 8 sgl step-on-n16
64 196608 8 sgl step-on-n16
64 131072 8 sgl step-on-n16
64 131072 6 sgl step-on-n16
64 131072 0 sgl step-copy-n16
